ndered_turn_sha256":"f7834e51e76e50edfc2b013b334d0e85fae82ee0b65757eeaca85e284368da4b","session_date":"2023-10-15","session_datetime":"2023-10-15T09:39:00","session_id":"session_23","session_index":23,"source_sha256":"df7c2177982afc61a478d0a0dcf934cf7b68c0e2766fee9fc08bac06e3c17f43","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":18}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- The 2023-10-15 conversation continued: Dave said The Fireworks headlined the festival (answering Calvin's question); Calvin: \"Wow, I heard great things about The Fireworks! Performing with Frank Ocean recently has been really cool. Seeing them perform live must've been awesome - I bet the energy was electric. That's why I love my job so much - connecting with the crowd.\" (Calvin's \"recently\" — the Frank Ocean tour he described to Dave on 2023-08-14 as having ended with the Tokyo show — suggests more recent performances with Frank Ocean; not confirmed) [S23T9][S23T10]. Dave: \"The crowd had such a buzz. Music brings people together in such an amazing way, and it's just like when I'm fixing up things. I love the feeling of taking something broken and making it whole again. That's why I keep doing what I do.\" Calvin: \"Music and repairing things are so fulfilling and satisfying. Seeing something go from broken to whole is incredible. You're making a difference too - it's amazing. Keep it up, friend.\" [S23T11][S23T12]. Dave thanked Calvin — his support \"really helps,\" it's \"great to have a friend who believes in me,\" and he'll \"keep pushing\" [S23T13]; Calvin: \"I believe in you, Dave. Keep pushing and never forget how awesome you are.\" [S23T14]; Dave: \"Your support means a lot. I'm gonna keep going and not forget my value!\" [S23T15]. Calvin closed the chat urging Dave to \"keep going for those dreams. You got this!\" and announced, \"Last week\" (~2023-10-09/15), he got a new Ferrari — \"a masterpiece on wheels\" — and is excited for \"thrilling rides and unforgettable journeys,\" sharing a photo of it (a black sports car parked in front of a building) — \"Perhaps a photo of this unique beauty will lift your mood.\" (details in ## New luxury car (Ferrari, 2023-03-26)) [S23T16]. The 2023-10-15 conversation then closed: Dave congratulated Calvin on the new Ferrari (\"that's incredible! Must be one amazing ride\"), said Calvin's positivity is contagious, and asked him to \"share a pic of your new beauty whenever you're ready\" and to \"keep the good vibes rolling\"; Calvin agreed the Ferrari \"is indeed a showstopper\" and said he'd \"share a pic soon,\" and the two signed off \"Here's to more thrilling rides and positive vibes... looking forward to catching up soon!\" [S23T17][S23T18].","text_sha256":"08347bf7c3c2dbc6825ba89d206eacaf0a2254af1fb1e03a8c94ac2eeb8c0732","timestamp":"2023-10-15T09:39:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D23:16","D23:17","D23:18"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":40,"line_start":40,"source_locators":["[S23T16]","[S23T17]","[S23T18]"],"text_sha256":"c70b8e7bd1ff03fc5793193787d2fc662b40ee6d02f67007f57c65a22ca4eab4"}],"dia_ids":["D23:16","D23:17","D23:18"],"evidence_id":"ev-befc33bc89b28320b514286580c71f618054ada7eecefd017af9a3912425d40b","group_id":"/memories/calvin.md > # Calvin","line_end":40,"line_start":40,"observation_ids":["obs-0004"],"path":"/memories/calvin.md","query_terms":[],"rank":null,"records_sha256":"130a5a1e1b75083358ef27a98dd215a4e75c819ace6f2ee9b560ba394e0f0394","retrieval_round":5,"schema_version":1,"score":null,"section":"# Calvin > ## New luxury car (Ferrari, 2023-03-26)","selection_ordinal":2,"session_id":"session_23","source_kind":"curated","source_locators":["[S23T16]","[S23T17]","[S23T18]"],"source_map_sha256":"6e99115961bae06a48bfb7e82dbdcc18dc32ccf6c5ce57e3c266dfc7a5d4d574","source_records":[{"dia_id":"D23:16","global_turn_ind