te":"2023-10-15","session_datetime":"2023-10-15T09:39:00","session_id":"session_23","session_index":23,"source_sha256":"db5df03ea01936122d52947038d685eeb9a81c8b9bb876c0a148322dc24665b9","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":16},{"dia_id":"D23:17","global_turn_index":400,"locator":"[S23T17]","raw_turn_sha256":"c98f6017214526d7eb2e75d2e9e35a9ae6f2548e0a4b3be5c8287f42c9dcc838","rendered_turn_sha256":"bc5516686f726ccf39cdba8c58e4f859f699d7f07fb2b1c02bec43a4504d978e","session_date":"2023-10-15","session_datetime":"2023-10-15T09:39:00","session_id":"session_23","session_index":23,"source_sha256":"58a6d81950160c13d1b7d29f45fd0bfbd995f0efd7b0d440984f27cb51b19838","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":17},{"dia_id":"D23:18","global_turn_index":401,"locator":"[S23T18]","raw_turn_sha256":"c8c5a2cf97d2bb8d61e4256faed99fb9c1f77cabeeba7c92b0e070ce5a9a8533","rendered_turn_sha256":"f7834e51e76e50edfc2b013b334d0e85fae82ee0b65757eeaca85e284368da4b","session_date":"2023-10-15","session_datetime":"2023-10-15T09:39:00","session_id":"session_23","session_index":23,"source_sha256":"df7c2177982afc61a478d0a0dcf934cf7b68c0e2766fee9fc08bac06e3c17f43","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":18}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- The 2023-10-15 conversation continued: Dave said The Fireworks headlined the festival (answering Calvin's question); Calvin: \"Wow, I heard great things about The Fireworks! Performing with Frank Ocean recently has been really cool. Seeing them perform live must've been awesome - I bet the energy was electric. That's why I love my job so much - connecting with the crowd.\" [S23T9][S23T10]. Dave: \"The crowd had such a buzz. Music brings people together in such an amazing way, and it's just like when I'm fixing up things. I love the feeling of taking something broken and making it whole again. That's why I keep doing what I do.\" (echoes his sense of purpose from fixing things — details in ## Hobbies and sense of purpose) Calvin: \"Music and repairing things are so fulfilling and satisfying. Seeing something go from broken to whole is incredible. You're making a difference too - it's amazing. Keep it up, friend.\" [S23T11][S23T12]. Dave thanked Calvin — his support \"really helps,\" it's \"great to have a friend who believes in me,\" and he'll \"keep pushing\" [S23T13]; Calvin: \"I believe in you, Dave. Keep pushing and never forget how awesome you are.\" [S23T14]; Dave: \"Your support means a lot. I'm gonna keep going and not forget my value!\" [S23T15]; Calvin closed urging Dave to \"keep going for those dreams. You got this!\", then announced he got a new Ferrari \"last week\" (~2023-10-09/15), sharing a photo of it (a black sports car parked in front of a building) — \"Perhaps a photo of this unique beauty will lift your mood.\" (Calvin's Ferrari details in the New luxury car section of /memories/calvin.md) [S23T16]. The 2023-10-15 conversation then closed: Dave thanked Calvin for the kind words and encouragement (\"Your positivity is contagious\"), congratulated him on the new Ferrari — \"that's incredible! Must be one amazing ride\" — and said he was \"all in for those thrilling journeys,\" asking Calvin to \"share a pic of your new beauty whenever you're ready\"; Calvin: \"The Ferrari is indeed a showstopper. I'll be sure to share a pic soon.\" — the two are now to keep sharing \"thrilling rides and positive vibes,\" and the chat closed with \"Take care, and looking forward to catching up soon!\" [S23T17][S23T18].","text_sha256":"51a86b6f9a31cb4e44ded397013a7d55396772f22995e24161388b94da690e71","timestamp":"2023-10-15T09:39:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D12:1"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":35,"line_start":35,"source_locators":["[S12T1]"],"text_sha256":"29f8644b14ad75ca85bed7c726d862ce007ea97eb98859b56073bceb9042fe17"}],"dia_ids":["D12:1"],"evi